{"approval":{"approvalContext":"Official thread 01a0049b-9b76-7e61-8c09-a35d0db4b7f2 records the user-approved 2026-08-15 revision. This decision supersedes character_visual_design_decision.character.seojin.1.v3 for current body, face, hair, costume, equipment, weapon, palette, materials, identifying features, pose, display-detail, required/prohibited, identity-lock, and single-image specification facts; historical v1/v3 bytes remain immutable. It explicitly supersedes v5-derived realistic adult face/body/detail aesthetics for this asset. External style evidence is content-bound only by SHA-256 cea3d711245c114e0fdd9f0890e11c589b1ec960ebcc82f95577e02b122b58af; its temporary transport path is not canonical identity. The evidence role is limited to proportion, sparse line density, contour omission, and color restraint; its person, pose, action, costume, and identity are not adopted.","approvedAt":"2026-08-15T17:52:53+09:00","authorityRole":"character_planning_owner","scope":"canonical_character_planning_revision_four_head_animation_safe_minimal_ink_line_character_single_image"},"characterId":"character.seojin.1","constraintRefs":[{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.json","section":"immutable historical character visual decision v1"},{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-data/character/design-decisions/v1/character.seojin.1.visual-design.v3.json","section":"immutable historical character visual decision v3 superseded for current v4 fields"},{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-guides/common/DisignMasterConcept_rule.md","section":"디자인 원칙 > 1, 3, 4, 5, 10 및 금지 규칙"},{"path":"AgentDocs/planning-guides/character/data-structures/CharacterPlanningDataGuide.md","section":"3.3 Structured appearance 및 3.4 Generated Media planning readiness"},{"path":"AgentDocs/task-prompts/character/ActCharacterPlanningPrompts.md","section":"current character planning and closed handoff workflow"}],"decisionId":"character_visual_design_decision.character.seojin.1.v4","decisionStatus":"approved","designFacts":{"seojin.appearance.body.v4":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/body","value":{"description":"20대 중후반의 젊은 성인 한국 남성으로 읽히는 정확히 약 4등신의 전신 비례. 전신은 3.75–4.25 heads 범위이고 머리 높이는 전신 높이의 24–27%이며, 팔다리는 짧고 단순화한다. 자연주의적 7–8등신 성인 해부나 영웅적 장신 비례는 사용하지 않는다."}},"seojin.appearance.costume.v4":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/costume","value":{"description":"빛바랜 남색 군졸복 층, 회갈색 포형 여행 겉옷, 수선된 반신 갑옷을 세 개의 단순하고 구분되는 flat mass로 유지한다. 반신 갑옷은 개별 미늘이나 리벳이 아니라 한 덩어리의 수선된 보호구 실루엣으로 표현하고, 복식의 촘촘한 주름·봉제선·해칭·얼룩·미세 텍스처는 생략한다."}},"seojin.appearance.equipment.v4":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/equipment","value":[{"description":"허리 뒤의 작은 여행 주머니 하나만 단순한 보조 실루엣으로 유지하며 보자기, 매듭, 표면 질감의 미세 디테일은 식별 요건으로 만들지 않는다."}]},"seojin.appearance.face.v4":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/face","value":{"description":"젊은 성인 한국 남성의 얼굴을 낮은 선 밀도로 표현한다. 깨끗한 턱선, 곧은 눈썹, 또렷하고 차분한 눈매만 high-signal 식별점으로 남기고 피부 결, 미세 주름, 촘촘한 음영, 사실적 해부 묘사는 생략한다."}},"seojin.appearance.hair.v4":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/hair","value":{"description":"검은 머리를 조선시대 젊은 성인 남성의 낮은 상투로 단정하게 묶는다. 상투와 머리 덩어리는 소수의 외곽선과 최대한 생략된 내부선으로 읽히게 하며 잔머리, 광택, 개별 모발 묘사는 사용하지 않는다."}},"seojin.appearance.identifying_features.v4":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/identifyingFeatures","value":["젊은 성인 한국 남성의 낮은 조선 상투와 차분한 눈매","빛바랜 남색 군졸복 층과 회갈색 포형 여행 겉옷의 두 accent mass","개별 미늘 없이 한 덩어리로 단순화한 수선된 반신 갑옷","허리에서 완전히 칼집에 든 장식 없는 조선식 환도"]},"seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v4":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/intendedDisplay","value":{"assetType":"character_single_image","backgroundPolicy":"transparent","detailDensity":{"description":"animation-safe low detail. 외곽선 밖의 구별 가능한 내부 선 stroke는 전신 합계 최대 18개, 얼굴·머리 합계 최대 6개, 복식·갑옷·무기 합계 최대 12개다. visible color/value mass는 neutral을 포함해 최대 5개, accent hue는 빛바랜 남색과 회갈색의 최대 2개이며 gradient는 0개다. 정체성은 낮은 상투, 남색 군졸복, 회갈색 겉옷, 단순화한 수선 반신 갑옷, 칼집에 든 환도의 high-signal points로만 유지한다.","level":"low"},"framingPolicy":"centered full-body head-to-toe with clear space around the approximately four-head silhouette; no crop","outputUsage":"인게임 전투와 캐릭터 선택 화면에서 서진의 4등신 실루엣과 소수의 정체성 포인트를 읽는 단일 전신 캐릭터 이미지","providerCanvasPolicy":"profile_owned_technical_canvas","targetDisplaySize":{"consumerViewportOrReference":"인게임 전투 카메라와 캐릭터 선택 화면에서 전신 높이 96~144px로 표시되는 단일 캐릭터 이미지","minimumPixelSize":{"height":96,"width":64},"targetPixelSize":{"height":144,"width":96},"unit":"px"}}},"seojin.appearance.materials.v4":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/materials","value":[{"appliesTo":"군졸복과 여행 겉옷","materialDescription":"재질 질감 없이 flat value mass로만 구분"},{"appliesTo":"수선된 반신 갑옷과 칼집에 든 환도","materialDescription":"광택·반사·표면 묘사 없이 flat dark mass로만 구분"}]},"seojin.appearance.palette.v4":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/palette","value":[{"appliesTo":"군졸복 층","colorDescription":"빛바랜 남색의 단일 flat accent hue"},{"appliesTo":"여행 겉옷과 작은 여행 주머니","colorDescription":"차분한 회갈색의 단일 flat accent hue"},{"appliesTo":"선, 단순화한 반신 갑옷, 환도 칼집","colorDescription":"먹색에 가까운 단일 neutral value"}]},"seojin.appearance.pose_policy.single_image.v4":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/posePolicy","value":{"description":"Neutral single-image standing pose with balanced weight and relaxed short limbs; the Joseon hwando remains fully sheathed and readable; no attack or action pose.","mode":"exact"}},"seojin.appearance.weapon.v4":{"fieldPath":"/appearance/weapon","value":{"description":"장식 없는 조선식 환도 한 자루를 단순한 짙은 칼집 실루엣으로 유지하고 항상 칼집에 둔다. 날, 리벳, 끈 결, 광택, 사실적 금속·목재 렌더링은 식별 요건으로 만들지 않는다.","present":true}},"seojin.single_image.identity_consistency_lock.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/identityConsistencyLock","value":{"identityId":"character.seojin.1","referenceFacts":[{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v3"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/genderPresentation"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v4"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/body"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.face.v4"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/face"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.hair.v4"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/hair"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v4"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/costume"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.equipment.v4"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/equipment"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.weapon.v4"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/weapon"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.handedness.v1"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/handedness"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.palette.v4"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/palette"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.materials.v4"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/materials"},{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.identifying_features.v4"],"sourcePointer":"/appearance/identifyingFeatures"}]}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.cinematic_lighting.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/12","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v4","seojin.appearance.materials.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.cinematic_lighting.v4","statement":"cinematic lighting이나 영화적 인물 조명을 사용하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.dense_folds.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/5","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v4","seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.dense_folds.v4","statement":"복식에 조밀한 주름선을 넣지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.foreign_design.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/14","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v4","seojin.appearance.weapon.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.foreign_design.v4","statement":"한국 이외 문화권의 갑옷, 검, 문양, 장식 또는 복식 실루엣을 포함하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.gradients.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/11","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v4","seojin.appearance.palette.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.gradients.v4","statement":"색 또는 명도 gradient를 사용하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.hatching.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/6","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.face.v4","seojin.appearance.costume.v4","seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.hatching.v4","statement":"얼굴·복식·갑옷·무기에 해칭을 넣지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.heroic_tall_proportion.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/1","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.heroic_tall_proportion.v4","statement":"영웅적으로 키가 크고 길게 늘인 신체 비례를 사용하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.individual_rivets.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/4","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v4","seojin.appearance.materials.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.individual_rivets.v4","statement":"갑옷이나 장비의 개별 리벳을 렌더링하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.individual_scales.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/3","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v4","seojin.appearance.materials.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.individual_scales.v4","statement":"갑옷의 개별 미늘을 렌더링하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.long_complex_limbs.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/2","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.long_complex_limbs.v4","statement":"길고 해부학적으로 복잡하게 묘사한 팔다리를 사용하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.luxury_hero.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/15","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v4","seojin.appearance.palette.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.luxury_hero.v4","statement":"새것처럼 빛나는 장수 갑옷, 왕실급 장식, 화려한 영웅 망토를 포함하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.material_shading.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/8","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.materials.v4","seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.material_shading.v4","statement":"복식·갑옷·무기에 사실적 재질 셰이딩을 넣지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.mature_weathered_face.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/17","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v3","seojin.appearance.face.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.mature_weathered_face.v4","statement":"중년·노년으로 읽히는 깊은 주름, 짙은 수염, 처진 얼굴선 또는 과도한 피로를 포함하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.microtexture.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/10","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.face.v4","seojin.appearance.materials.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.microtexture.v4","statement":"피부·천·금속·나무에 미세 텍스처를 넣지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.modern_westernized_beauty.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/18","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.gender_presentation.v3","seojin.appearance.face.v4","seojin.appearance.hair.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.modern_westernized_beauty.v4","statement":"현대 아이돌 스타일, 서양화된 얼굴 비례, 미성년 표현, 성적 대상화 또는 화려한 미용 장식을 포함하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.realistic_material_rendering.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/13","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.materials.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.realistic_material_rendering.v4","statement":"사실적인 금속·천·가죽·목재 재질 렌더링을 사용하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.seven_to_eight_heads.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/0","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.seven_to_eight_heads.v4","statement":"자연주의적 7–8등신 성인 신체 비례를 사용하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.skin_shading.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/7","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.face.v4","seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.skin_shading.v4","statement":"피부에 사실적 또는 단계적인 셰이딩을 넣지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.stains.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/9","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.costume.v4","seojin.appearance.materials.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.stains.v4","statement":"옷과 장비에 얼룩 렌더링을 넣지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.prohibition.supernatural_body.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/prohibitedElements/16","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v4","seojin.appearance.face.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.prohibition.supernatural_body.v4","statement":"뿔, 발광 눈, 괴이한 피부색 또는 비인간형 팔다리를 포함하지 않는다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.four_head_proportion.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/0","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.body.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.four_head_proportion.v4","statement":"전신은 3.75–4.25 heads이고 머리 높이는 전신 높이의 24–27%인 약 4등신이어야 하며 팔다리는 짧고 단순해야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.identity_points.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/1","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.hair.v4","seojin.appearance.costume.v4","seojin.appearance.identifying_features.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.identity_points.v4","statement":"낮은 조선 상투, 빛바랜 남색 군졸복, 회갈색 여행 겉옷, 한 덩어리로 단순화한 수선 반신 갑옷이 소수의 high-signal 식별점으로 보여야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.neutral_standing.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/4","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.pose_policy.single_image.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.neutral_standing.v4","statement":"한 장의 중립 전신 서 있는 자세와 하나의 viewpoint만 사용한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.sheathed_hwando.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/2","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.weapon.v4","seojin.appearance.pose_policy.single_image.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.sheathed_hwando.v4","statement":"장식 없는 조선식 환도는 허리에서 완전히 칼집에 든 단순한 실루엣으로 보여야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.requirement.sparse_ink_line.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/requiredElements/3","value":{"evidenceFactIds":["seojin.appearance.intended_display.single_image.v4","seojin.appearance.palette.v4","seojin.appearance.materials.v4"],"factId":"seojin.single_image.requirement.sparse_ink_line.v4","statement":"절제된 East Asian ink-line 표현에서 외곽선 밖 내부 선은 최대 18개이고, 색·명도 덩어리는 최대 5개이며, accent hue는 최대 2개여야 한다."}},"seojin.single_image.specification.v4":{"fieldPath":"/generatedMediaPlanning/characterSingleImage/singleImageSpecification","value":{"anchor":{"groundContactAxis":"horizontal normalized line from (0.25,0.92) to (0.75,0.92)","pelvisOrRootPoint":"normalized canvas point (0.5,0.55)","type":"pelvis_root_ground_axis"},"canvas":{"height":1536,"width":1024},"finalBackgroundPolicy":"transparent","framing":"centered full-body head-to-toe with clear space around the approximately four-head silhouette; no crop","generationBackground":{"color":"#F2EFE6","mode":"removable_solid"},"noShadow":true,"outline":{"color":"#1F1A17","enabled":true,"exactThicknessPx":3,"placement":"outside_silhouette"},"pose":"neutral grounded standing pose; balanced weight; relaxed short limbs; Joseon hwando fully sheathed; no attack or action pose","safeArea":"left 96 px, right 96 px, top 96 px, bottom 128 px; the complete subject must remain inside all four insets","targetDisplaySize":{"height":144,"width":96},"viewpoint":"front three-quarter design view, one approved viewpoint only"}}},"schemaVersion":"character_visual_design_decision_v1"}
